{comment: Verse 1}
Bbm 7 CbM 9
This is the day the Lord has made. I will rejoice, I will give Him praise.
Bbm 7 (Eb E F Ab Bb Ab Bb F Eb Db)
He put joy down in my soul.
Bbm 7 CbM 9
Renewed my spirit and He made me whole.

